# MaCSad board workspace

Import AdminPolicy from "./admin_policy.lg".

The navigable board owns its draft and health signals and imports the policy leaf
that defines the six-state shape and terminal Closed behavior.

## Component BoardWorkspace:
    Let draftTitle be a signal "".
    Let draftState be a signal "Nothing staged yet".
    Let healthState be a signal "Not checked".
    Let columnCount be kanbanColumnCount().
    Let ordinaryClosedWorkAllowed be closedAcceptsOrdinaryWork(false).
    Let phases be ["Inbox", "Ready", "Running", "Verify", "Review", "Closed"].
    View:
        css ".page-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; } .page-head > div { flex: 1 1 320px; } .kicker { margin: 0 0 9px; color: #146878; font: 800 11px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; } .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; } h1 { margin: 0; color: #102c3b; font: 750 clamp(30px,4vw,48px)/1.04 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.035em; } .lede { max-width: 680px; margin: 12px 0 0; color: #59666d; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; } .health-card { flex: 1 1 250px; min-width: min(250px,100%); max-width: 360px; padding: 14px 15px; background: #fffdf7; border: 1px solid #d9d5c9; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(16,44,59,.06); } .health-card small { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #6c787e; font: 700 10px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; } .health-readout { min-height: 34px; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #1d3b48; font: 600 11px/1.45 ui-monospace, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; } .secondary-button { padding: 8px 11px; color: #f8f6ef; background: #153d4d; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; font: 700 11px/1 inherit; cursor: pointer; } .metric-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 22px; } .metric { padding: 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.68); border: 1px solid #d9d5c9; border-radius: 12px; } .metric span { display: block; color: #6e7a80; font-size: 11px; } .metric strong { display: block; margin-top: 7px; color: #173442; font: 750 22px/1 Georgia, serif; } .draft-panel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(210px,100%),1fr)); gap: 12px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 16px; background: #fffdf7; border: 1px solid #d8d3c6; border-radius: 14px; } .field label { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; color: #35464f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; } .field input { width: 100%; min-height: 42px; padding: 10px 12px; color: #19333f; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #c8c5bb; border-radius: 8px; outline: none; font: 13px/1.2 inherit; } .field input:focus { border-color: #16758a; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(22,117,138,.12); } .draft-action { min-height: 42px; padding: 10px 16px; color: #102c3b; background: #d8ff72; border: 1px solid #bbdf5a; border-radius: 9px; font: 800 12px/1 inherit; cursor: pointer; } .draft-truth { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: #68747a; font-size: 11px; } .truth-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: #e3a52a; } .board-scroll { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; padding: 2px 2px 16px; } .board { min-width: 1460px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6,minmax(220px,1fr)); gap: 12px; } .column { min-height: 400px; padding: 13px; background: #e6e3da; border: 1px solid #d3cfc3; border-radius: 14px; } .column-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 2px 2px 12px; } .column-head h3 { margin: 0; color: #283c47; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .02em; } .count { min-width: 24px; padding: 4px 7px; color: #627078; background: #f7f4ec; border: 1px solid #d3cfc3; border-radius: 999px; font: 700 10px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; text-align: center; } .card { margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 14px; background: #fffdf8; border: 1px solid #d6d2c7; border-radius: 11px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(16,44,59,.05); } .card-tag { margin: 0 0 9px; color: #16758a; font: 800 9px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .11em; text-transform: uppercase; } .card h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1b3440; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; } .card p { margin: 0; color: #69757b; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; } .empty { padding: 18px 10px; color: #869096; border: 1px dashed #c7c3b8; border-radius: 9px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.45; text-align: center; } button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #16758a; outline-offset: 3px; } @media (max-width: 820px) { .page-head { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; } .health-card { min-width: 0; } .draft-truth { grid-column: auto; } }"
        div [class="page-head"]:
            div:
                p [class="kicker"]: "Process control / six states"
                span [class="sr-only"]: "The board has {columnCount} phases."
                h1: "Research work, made navigable."
                p [class="lede"]: "A quiet control surface for cases, roles, evidence, and handoffs. Every future transition will be an explicit command with policy, version, and audit checks."
            div [class="health-card"]:
                small: "Gateway health · GET only"
                p [class="health-readout"]: "{healthState}"
                button [class="secondary-button"]:
                    on click:
                        Set healthState to "Checking /api/v1/health …".
                        Let onHealth be (requestId: Int) ->:
                            Set healthState to responseText().
                        Call fetchText with "/api/v1/health" and onHealth.
                    span: "Check connection"
        div [class="metric-grid"]:
            div [class="metric"]:
                span: "Open cases"
                strong: "03"
            div [class="metric"]:
                span: "Active agents"
                strong: "00"
            div [class="metric"]:
                span: "Awaiting evidence"
                strong: "01"
            div [class="metric"]:
                span: "Published today"
                strong: "00"
        div [class="draft-panel"]:
            div [class="field"]:
                label: "Draft a research question"
                input [type="text", aria-label="Draft a research question", placeholder="e.g. Find a minimal counterexample…", bound to draftTitle]:
            button [class="draft-action"]:
                on click:
                    Set draftState to "Draft staged in this browser only — no command was sent".
                span: "Stage local draft"
            div [class="draft-truth"]:
                span [class="truth-dot"]: ""
                span: "{draftState}"
        div [class="board-scroll"]:
            div [class="board"]:
                for each phase in phases:
                    section [class="column"]:
                        div [class="column-head"]:
                            h3: "{phase}"
                            span [class="count"]: "0"
                        when phase is equal to "Inbox":
                            article [class="card"]:
                                p [class="card-tag"]: "Case · seed"
                                h4: "Characterize sparse verifier search"
                                p: "Example fixture only · unassigned · not persisted"
                        when phase is equal to "Ready":
                            article [class="card"]:
                                p [class="card-tag"]: "Policy check"
                                h4: "Define admissible evidence"
                                p: "Example fixture only · awaiting human approval"
                        when phase is equal to "Running":
                            div [class="empty"]: "No agent run has been started."
                        when phase is equal to "Verify":
                            div [class="empty"]: "Evidence gates will appear here."
                        when phase is equal to "Review":
                            div [class="empty"]: "Human decisions remain explicit."
                        when phase is equal to "Closed":
                            when ordinaryClosedWorkAllowed:
                                div [class="empty"]: "Ordinary work is available."
                            otherwise:
                                div [class="empty"]: "Closed work is terminal unless an authorized reopen command succeeds."
